{"seq":3,"slug":"visionary-legacy","title":"远见的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/visionary-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inspiring-a-generation","title":"激励一代人","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/visionary-legacy/inspiring-a-generation","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-multiplanetary-dream","title":"多行星梦想","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/visionary-legacy/the-multiplanetary-dream","wordCount":1503,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 远见的遗产\n\n马斯克最无形、也最深远的遗产，在于他对人类精神与想象的影响。本章揭示这份远见的遗产。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"激励一代人\"——他如何重燃人们对硬科技与宏大梦想的热情。第二篇文档讲述\"多行星梦想\",呈现他让人类成为多行星物种的宏愿，如何改变了人类对自身未来的想象。\n"}